needsAlignment: 2
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Greater Ride Buddy, for the Pure Good only: 6 Squares more, and the Nimbus Pro Enhancement.
text: >
  Nimbus: This mystical flying cloud decides who it allows to ride it.
  –Special Buddy Type: Greater
  –Original Buddy: Ride Buddy
  –Effects: You can only use the Buddy Effect of this Buddy if you are Pure Good. Increase the
  number of Squares you can move through the Buddy Effect of this Buddy by 6. Additionally,
  while this Buddy is Active, you have access to the Nimbus Pro Enhancement.

---

# Its Buddy Effect only with a Pure Good Alignment, on the Biography tab.
